  "title": "二分搜索",
  "domain": "programming",
  "content": "字面理解就是将要判断的数据不断二分从而找到要的数据\n\n对于有序的数组好用学[[排序初步二分法前提]]\n\n具体实操方案如\n#include<stdio.h>\nint  search(int key, int a[], int len)\n{\n\tint ret = -1;\n\tint left = 0;\n\tint right = len-1;\n\twhile(right>left)\n\t{\n\t\tint mid = (left+right)/2;\n\t\tif ( a[mid] == k)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\t ret = mid;\n\t\t\t break;\n\t\t}else if( a[mid]>k)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tright = mid-1;\n\t\t}else {\n\t\t\tleft = mid+1;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn ret;\n}\nint main()\n{\n\tint k = 10;\n\tint r  = search(k, amount, sizeof(amount)/sizeof(amount[0]) );\n\treturn 0;\n}",
